# Artifact chunks are gzipped JSON Lines and are large: the full run is 3.7 GB across 441 files, with the
# biggest single chunk at 13 MB. Git stores binary blobs whole per revision, so committing these directly
# would make every future clone pay for every past regeneration. LFS keeps the working tree usable.
*.jsonl.gz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Everything else is text and should diff normally.
*.json text
*.md text
*.cs text
